OL,3,GNEWSAObama says drift towards extremism
OL,4,A'not inevitable'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBarack Obama has told an audience in
OL,7,FGlasgow that hope is worth fighting for
OL,8,Fdespite big challenges facing the
OL,9,Fmodern world.
OL,11,FThe 44th president of the United States
OL,12,Fsaid online platforms had shifted in
OL,13,Frecent years to focus on content that
OL,14,Fstoked anger and fear, but he believes
OL,15,Fa drift to extremism is "not
OL,16,Finevitable".
OL,18,FThe comments came as he addressed an
OL,19,FOVO Hydro crowd of 12,150 people while
OL,20,Fin conversation with British journalist
OL,21,Fand author Sathnam Sanghera, part of
OL,22,Fthree speaking dates in the UK.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,428,420,260,160,0,100
